			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<strong>Effective Date: 03/10/2026</strong>

By using the services provided by Magnolia Air (“we,” “us,” or “our”), you agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please refrain from using our services.

<strong>Brand Name</strong>
Magnolia Air

<strong>Types of Messages You May Receive</strong>
By providing your contact information and opting into communications from us, you agree to receive the following types of messages:
<ul>
 	<li>Appointment reminders</li>
 	<li>Service updates</li>
 	<li>Promotional and marketing messages</li>
 	<li>Informational and customer support messages</li>
</ul>
<strong>Message Frequency Disclosure</strong>
The frequency of messages you receive may vary depending on service needs, appointment schedules, and promotional campaigns. For appointment-related communications, you may receive up to two messages per appointment.

<strong>Opt-In for SMS Notifications</strong>
By providing your phone number and opting in to receive text messages, you consent to receive SMS notifications from Magnolia Air, including appointment reminders, service updates, and promotional communications. Consent to receive these messages is not a condition of purchase. You may opt in either in person or during a phone call initiated by you.

Upon first registration, you will be asked for your phone number and notified about the possibility of receiving text messages, including the following:
<ul>
 	<li>Message and data rates may apply</li>
 	<li>Message frequency may vary</li>
 	<li>Instructions on how to unsubscribe by replying “STOP” or requesting help by replying “HELP”</li>
 	<li>Your contact information will not be shared with third parties for marketing or promotional purposes</li>
</ul>
<strong>Message and Data Rates Disclosure</strong>
Standard message and data rates may apply when receiving text messages from us. Please check with your mobile carrier for details regarding any applicable charges.

<strong>Opt-Out Instructions</strong>
You may opt out of receiving all SMS communications at any time by replying “STOP” to any message you receive from us. If you need assistance, reply “HELP” or contact us at <a href="mailto:digital@explorehvac.com"><strong>digital@explorehvac.com</strong></a>.

<strong>Customer Care Contact Information</strong>
For any questions or concerns regarding our messages, services, or this policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:digital@explorehvac.com"><strong>digital@explorehvac.com</strong></a>.

<strong>Privacy and Data Security</strong>
We are committed to protecting your privacy. Your contact information will only be used for the purposes described above and will not be sold or shared with third parties for marketing purposes. For additional details, please review our <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>.

<strong>Changes to These Terms and Conditions</strong>
We reserve the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be posted on our website, with the effective date updated accordingly.

<strong>Carrier Disclaimer:</strong>
Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery is subject to effective transmission from your mobile service provider and network availability.Magnolia Air is not responsible for any message failures, delays, or errors caused by mobile carriers or third-party service providers.

<strong>Age Requirement:</strong>
By using this website and opting in to receive SMS communications from Magnolia Air, you confirm that you are at least <strong>18 years of age</strong>. Our services and communications are not intended for individuals under the age of 18.

<strong>Acceptance of Terms</strong>
By using our services, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms and Conditions]]></content:encoded>
